    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends will be launched into the world of Birddawg X. Players will traverse the canyon map (level 1) in search of rings and ammo. The pick-ups are spread across the level and it is your duty to collect 50+ rings in order to unlock the championship ring. In New York City (level 2) collect 100+ rings, then on the moon (level 3)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through the skies and stall out your competitor by shooting them with arrows until their health is depleted.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GoodLuck on the battle field players. All the best.\u00a0</p>",
